<title>MALAYSIA: Timberwell shares debut at 6.50 rgt.</title>
<headline>Timberwell shares debut at 6.50 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Timberwell Bhd made their market debut at 6.50 ringgit against an offer price of 3.60.</p>
<p>Around five minutes into the opening, the stock of the timber harvesting, trading and property firm was at 6.90 ringgit on volume of 1.3 million shares traded.  </p>
<p>Timberwell offered 6.0 million vendor shares for its public listing.</p>
<p>The company forecast net profit of 9.48 million ringgit for the year ended December 31, 1997, against 7.53 million in the previous year.</p>
